 direct value, returned state, or draft recipe. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3035":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-15","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method                       | Availability           | Purpose                                                  |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `transaction(metadata?, fn)` | State-owning timelines | Atomically group synchronous operations; one root event. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3036":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-16","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method                 | Availability           | Purpose                    |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `batch(metadata?, fn)` | State-owning timelines | Alias for `transaction()`. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3037":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-17","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method                        | Availability        | Purpose                                                      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `recordPatches(state, entry)` | Controlled journals | Record an external owner’s exact forward/inverse patch pair. |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"3038":{"id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods-18","page_id":"/docs/reference/instance-methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/instance-methods#updates-and-grouping","content":"| Method               | Availability              | Purpose                         