[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","content":"确认 `docs/compatibility.md` 仍与运行时支持情况一致。","locale":"zh"},"6485":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","content":"把版本与变更日志的改动提交到 `main`。","locale":"zh"},"6486":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"如果主版本更改了工厂函数或恢复边界，请按依赖顺序发布：","locale":"zh"},"6487":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"完成本清单中所有 Travels 检查项，并基于经过测试的确切产物发布 `travels@3`。","locale":"zh"},"6488":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"在干净的 `use-travel` 与 `zustand-travel` 检出目录中安装已发布的核心包。把它们的 `mutative` peer 范围与开发依赖范围提升到 Travels 要求的范围（Travels 3 为 `^2.0.0`），将锁文件更新到已发布版本，并重新运行每个仓库的类型检查、测试、生产构建与包冒烟测试。","locale":"zh"},"6489":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"只有这些基于已发布核心包的运行全部通过后，才发布各绑定的主版本。","locale":"zh"},"6490":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"在一个干净的使用方项目中，把三个已发布包全部与 `mutative@2` 一起安装，确认安装过程没有报告 peer 依赖冲突，并对新建时间线与原子恢复的时间线做冒烟测试。","locale":"zh"},"6491":{"id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/resources/release-checklist#协调发布-v3-绑定","content":"本地同级链接是有用的候选证据，但不能取代第 2 步和第 4 步中针对已发布包